WEBVTT

00:09.020 --> 00:11.980
[Episode 2]

00:16.550 --> 00:17.850
The Wu and Yao Clans fell,

00:18.550 --> 00:20.330
while humans and dragons rose.

00:20.800 --> 00:22.850
Such was the Primordial Era.

00:23.190 --> 00:26.210
The six ancient races fought endlessly.

00:26.350 --> 00:29.420
Humans won and ruled the world.

00:29.440 --> 00:32.770
Hongjun preached the Way;
Three Pure Ones parted.

00:33.110 --> 00:33.730
Ling'e,

00:33.920 --> 00:34.330
you...

00:38.350 --> 00:39.130
Ling'e?

00:42.150 --> 00:44.860
Li Changshou, wake up your junior!

00:44.960 --> 00:46.330
You put her to sleep,

00:46.350 --> 00:47.770
so you're responsible.

00:47.960 --> 00:49.180
You wretched disciple!

00:49.790 --> 00:50.370
Who called me?

00:50.600 --> 00:51.770
Mentor, real combat?

00:51.840 --> 00:52.770
Is it real combat now?

00:53.320 --> 00:54.130
Real combat?

00:54.430 --> 00:55.220
Real combat?

00:56.350 --> 00:57.860
Eat one bite at a time.

00:57.880 --> 00:58.410
Time to eat?

00:58.430 --> 00:59.260
Nonsense.

00:59.280 --> 01:00.090
Eat what?

01:00.110 --> 01:01.940
Read one book at a time.

01:02.320 --> 01:03.260
What are you writing?

01:03.960 --> 01:05.620
Yes, yes, yes.

01:05.680 --> 01:07.260
Why write all that down?

01:07.280 --> 01:08.490
That's what I was thinking.

01:08.920 --> 01:10.770
As a small branch
of the Pureheaven Sect,

01:11.480 --> 01:13.210
shouldn't we know this history?

01:14.000 --> 01:14.770
Yes.

01:17.230 --> 01:18.660
Sect disciples are divided

01:19.230 --> 01:22.020
into four stages,
which are the Refining Stage,

01:22.040 --> 01:23.290
the Ascension Stage, the Reversion Stage,
and the Reunion Stage.

01:23.480 --> 01:26.210
Each stage has nine phases.

01:26.430 --> 01:29.770
Each phase is fraught with perils.

01:29.920 --> 01:31.410
Perils.

01:31.430 --> 01:34.130
Talent, will, and fortune
are all essential.

01:36.920 --> 01:37.740
Mentor,

01:37.870 --> 01:38.740
what comes after the Reunion Stage?

01:39.510 --> 01:42.820
After that, one may face
the Tribulation.

01:42.920 --> 01:45.540
If they survive,
they'll become immortals.

01:45.760 --> 01:46.850
This is further divided

01:46.950 --> 01:50.130
into Primal Immortal, Verity Immortal,
Celestial Immortal, and Aureate Immortal.

01:50.150 --> 01:52.740
In all of Ascendance Sect,

01:53.070 --> 01:54.130
few have reached

01:54.760 --> 01:56.490
such a realm.

01:57.760 --> 01:59.850
Patience, patience.

02:00.430 --> 02:02.020
Just have a little patience.

02:02.350 --> 02:02.850
Alright.

02:03.760 --> 02:05.180
When you can at last

02:05.280 --> 02:08.660
ignite this mid-level talisman,

02:10.750 --> 02:13.220
you'll have truly started.

02:29.080 --> 02:30.260
Wait, I...

02:30.470 --> 02:31.130
I didn't...

02:31.150 --> 02:32.570
I didn't hear you say anything.

02:32.870 --> 02:34.500
How did it just ignite?

02:34.520 --> 02:36.450
I felt that the talisman
was calling for me.

02:36.840 --> 02:38.540
Then, in an instant, a warm current

02:38.560 --> 02:39.820
slipped through my fingers.

02:39.840 --> 02:41.220
A prodigy!

02:42.750 --> 02:44.130
A prodigy!

02:44.310 --> 02:46.890
Our division has a prodigy!

02:46.960 --> 02:48.060
Ancestral masters above!

02:48.080 --> 02:50.690
Our division has a prodigy!

02:51.360 --> 02:52.130
A prodigy!

02:52.630 --> 02:53.260
A prodigy!

02:53.560 --> 02:54.780
A prodigy!

02:55.960 --> 02:56.890
Time to offer incense!

02:57.030 --> 02:58.340
Mentor is too easily pleased.

02:59.470 --> 03:01.170
So, I'm a formal disciple now?

03:02.630 --> 03:03.890
Offering incense won't help.

03:04.430 --> 03:05.610
Better let me

03:06.120 --> 03:07.570
teach you practical combat.

03:08.120 --> 03:08.890
Senior?

03:09.470 --> 03:10.410
Where did you come from?

03:10.590 --> 03:11.540
I've been here all along.

03:11.710 --> 03:13.130
Right beneath this earth vein.

03:13.280 --> 03:13.690
Earth...

03:16.190 --> 03:17.260
What a marvelous spell!

03:17.560 --> 03:19.100
Do you still recall the answer
from that day?

03:19.870 --> 03:20.410
I do.

03:20.560 --> 03:21.340
Pretend I didn't see it.

03:21.360 --> 03:22.290
And go find you.

03:22.710 --> 03:23.260
Yes.

03:23.520 --> 03:25.130
Then, if you're in danger
and need to escape,

03:25.150 --> 03:27.220
what do you rely on to come find me?

03:29.680 --> 03:30.780
My own wits.

03:31.080 --> 03:31.850
Wrong.

03:33.030 --> 03:35.500
Now, I'll teach you the second lesson.

03:35.560 --> 03:37.340
The art I just used:

03:37.430 --> 03:38.290
the Evasion Art.

03:38.680 --> 03:40.850
If you need to escape to find me,

03:40.870 --> 03:42.060
you'll rely on this art.

03:42.470 --> 03:43.690
I'll only show you once.

03:43.960 --> 03:44.780
Watch closely.

03:46.750 --> 03:47.850
When the heaven and earth intertwine,

03:48.310 --> 03:49.380
transformation arises.

03:51.280 --> 03:52.060
Senior!

03:52.310 --> 03:54.610
With this art,
you can travel freely underground.

03:54.630 --> 03:55.940
Nothing can stand in your way.

03:56.150 --> 03:57.780
Senior, that's amazing!

03:58.680 --> 03:59.850
If you meet a mighty foe,

03:59.870 --> 04:02.010
use it at once and find me.

04:02.030 --> 04:02.940
Understand?

04:03.630 --> 04:04.690
Yes, Senior.

04:06.430 --> 04:08.010
Isn't this Mentor's flute?

04:09.470 --> 04:10.660
I sneaked into his quarters

04:10.680 --> 04:11.980
and took it as a teaching aid.

04:12.000 --> 04:12.890
Return it for me.

04:13.840 --> 04:14.290
All right.

04:15.150 --> 04:16.490
What I showed you just now

04:16.680 --> 04:17.580
is called Earth Evasion.

04:17.600 --> 04:18.850
One of Five-Element Evasions.

04:18.920 --> 04:22.410
Master all five within three years.

04:23.430 --> 04:24.370
This scripture

04:24.390 --> 04:25.660
is profound and boundless.

04:25.830 --> 04:28.290
Recite day and night, learn by heart.

04:33.040 --> 04:34.170
The Scripture of Steadiness?

04:36.510 --> 04:38.050
But I've never heard of it.

04:38.120 --> 04:39.540
Who wrote this, Senior?

04:40.510 --> 04:42.170
Look at my face. Who do you think?

04:42.560 --> 04:44.700
Then it must be you, Senior.

04:46.750 --> 04:49.460
[Scripture of Steadiness]
All my experience is in it.

04:49.800 --> 04:52.220
Concise yet profound, deep yet simple.

04:52.240 --> 04:57.340
Blending classics and history,
serious and witty.

05:01.240 --> 05:01.930
Dwell in peace, yet think of danger.

05:01.950 --> 05:02.490
Think of misfortune.

05:02.510 --> 05:02.980
Act with steadiness.

05:03.000 --> 05:03.730
Reject entanglement with karma.

05:04.950 --> 05:05.700
May I ask a question?

05:05.720 --> 05:06.460
Sure.

05:07.750 --> 05:08.540
Senior,

05:08.560 --> 05:10.780
has your handwriting
always been this bad?

05:13.720 --> 05:15.290
Copy it one hundred times.

05:16.310 --> 05:17.610
Due by tomorrow morning.

05:21.920 --> 05:23.460
No!

05:27.540 --> 05:30.980
[Jade Division]

06:34.880 --> 06:35.540
My fish!

06:36.040 --> 06:36.730
What are you doing, Ling'e?

06:36.750 --> 06:37.500
You're not training hard enough.

06:37.520 --> 06:38.930
No, it wasn't me, Mentor.

06:38.950 --> 06:39.460
It was not me.

06:39.480 --> 06:40.380
Always up to mischief.

06:40.950 --> 06:41.890
My fish!

06:41.890 --> 06:47.390
♪An unexpected meeting
in this Primordial World♪

06:49.230 --> 06:50.100
Here, Mentor.

06:50.100 --> 06:53.870
♪This lad, at first, is hard to admire♪

06:54.250 --> 06:58.730
♪In a flash, I recall our near misses♪

06:59.220 --> 07:06.200
♪Fearing inescapable karmic threads♪

07:08.160 --> 07:12.530
♪Someone has unsettled your heart♪

07:12.530 --> 07:17.290
♪An edge hides, yet flows with ease♪

07:18.030 --> 07:24.500
♪Making me lean down and confirm slowly♪

07:26.290 --> 07:29.190
♪Not knowing what love truly is♪

07:29.190 --> 07:31.250
♪Just as it was at first♪

07:31.250 --> 07:35.240
♪Day after day, with whom to share♪

07:35.470 --> 07:39.380
♪Never walked the road
of joy and sorrow♪

07:39.580 --> 07:43.280
♪No better than a mortal♪

07:43.700 --> 07:46.460
♪Not knowing love's depth♪

07:46.700 --> 07:48.560
♪Who truly cares♪

07:48.920 --> 07:52.640
♪How to walk this different path
with you♪

07:53.000 --> 07:57.070
♪At storm's end, stars gleam,
and clouds drift♪

07:57.360 --> 08:01.470
♪Together we smile,
watching moonrise and sunset♪

08:15.740 --> 08:17.580
[Pull Strings]

08:17.580 --> 08:19.780
[Adapted from the novel
by Yan Gui Zheng Zhuan]

08:21.740 --> 08:23.500
[3 years later]

08:23.520 --> 08:23.940
Senior,

08:24.430 --> 08:25.220
lately,

08:25.240 --> 08:27.620
I've been training the Invisibility Art,

08:27.680 --> 08:30.010
no appetite for food or tea,

08:30.240 --> 08:31.820
devoting myself entirely.

08:31.840 --> 08:33.410
Enough, enough. Stop talking.

08:34.150 --> 08:35.620
Show me already.

08:35.750 --> 08:36.220
Go now.

08:36.430 --> 08:37.220
Wait for me.

08:47.030 --> 08:47.610
Senior,

08:47.630 --> 08:49.460
can you see me now?

08:49.550 --> 08:51.370
Guess: Am I over here,

08:51.440 --> 08:53.220
or over here?

08:54.030 --> 08:54.700
Junior.

08:55.030 --> 08:55.610
You can't see me now, can you?

08:55.630 --> 08:56.770
Junior, where are you? Junior!

08:56.790 --> 08:57.650
You cannot see me.

08:57.670 --> 08:58.420
Truly impressive.

08:58.440 --> 08:58.820
Junior.

08:59.510 --> 09:00.850
I can't find the way back.

09:00.870 --> 09:01.420
Where are you?

09:01.440 --> 09:02.220
Guess where I am.

09:02.320 --> 09:03.700
- Where am I?
- Junior.

09:03.790 --> 09:04.940
Are you here, Junior?

09:05.120 --> 09:05.850
I am not here.

09:05.910 --> 09:06.300
Junior.

09:06.320 --> 09:06.940
I am over here.

09:07.630 --> 09:08.420
Junior.

09:10.200 --> 09:10.980
Junior.

09:11.000 --> 09:11.650
How could you see me?

09:11.670 --> 09:12.370
You are invisible, huh?

09:12.390 --> 09:13.340
I did turn invisible.

09:13.360 --> 09:14.100
You practiced for so long, huh?

09:14.600 --> 09:15.370
You must be

09:15.630 --> 09:16.530
making fun of me!

09:17.120 --> 09:17.610
You even made me come here.

09:22.060 --> 09:26.420
[Hall of Mortal Coils]

09:26.900 --> 09:29.500
[Hall of Mortal Coils]

09:32.780 --> 09:34.620
[Jiu Wu, 5th disciple
of Griefbane Division]

09:34.620 --> 09:36.460
[Elder of Ascendance Sect,
Warden of Hall of Mortal Coils]

10:19.630 --> 10:21.220
I focused on this side of the board,

10:21.240 --> 10:22.250
yet I missed

10:22.270 --> 10:24.770
the mess on the other side.

10:24.870 --> 10:26.180
With one careless move,

10:26.270 --> 10:27.530
the whole game is lost.

10:28.480 --> 10:29.250
Uncle,

10:29.360 --> 10:30.650
your weiqi skills are superb.

10:30.670 --> 10:32.700
I won by pure luck.

10:34.200 --> 10:34.730
Enough.

10:35.000 --> 10:35.610
Well.

10:35.630 --> 10:37.220
I accept the loss.

10:38.000 --> 10:39.650
What do you want this time?

10:41.600 --> 10:42.180
Uncle,

10:42.670 --> 10:43.370
here's the thing.

10:44.270 --> 10:45.610
In a few days,

10:45.630 --> 10:47.490
we'll have our once-every-thirty-years

10:47.510 --> 10:48.850
Trial Assembly, right?

10:48.960 --> 10:49.370
Yes.

10:49.630 --> 10:51.700
You serve

10:51.840 --> 10:54.100
as Warden of the Hall

10:54.270 --> 10:56.980
and oversee the event.

10:57.480 --> 10:58.820
It must be hard on you.

10:59.630 --> 11:00.180
Right, right.

11:00.360 --> 11:00.940
That's right.

11:00.960 --> 11:01.770
You are absolutely right.

11:02.670 --> 11:04.460
Don't beat around the bush.

11:04.630 --> 11:05.100
Just say it.

11:05.120 --> 11:06.250
Then I shall be direct.

11:07.550 --> 11:08.420
I'd like

11:09.080 --> 11:10.060
to take a look

11:10.550 --> 11:11.770
at the Spirit Treasure Map.

11:12.960 --> 11:13.770
The Spirit Treasure...

11:15.550 --> 11:16.650
Why do you want to see that?

11:16.670 --> 11:18.010
You know me, Uncle.

11:18.120 --> 11:19.530
My cultivation's too low.

11:19.630 --> 11:21.820
I can't compete for treasures.

11:22.960 --> 11:23.850
I just want

11:23.870 --> 11:26.100
to feast my eyes on it.

11:26.150 --> 11:27.490
That will be quite enough.

11:28.080 --> 11:28.730
I see.

11:28.750 --> 11:30.300
You have no real skills,

11:30.750 --> 11:32.130
so you want to cheat,

11:32.480 --> 11:33.850
get some good Spirit Treasures,

11:33.870 --> 11:35.100
and then run away, right?

11:35.480 --> 11:37.060
You lost, Uncle.

11:37.870 --> 11:38.610
Rest assured.

11:38.630 --> 11:39.820
I always

11:39.840 --> 11:42.730
keep my word.

11:45.630 --> 11:46.300
You want to see it, right?

11:46.550 --> 11:47.850
Come, get ready.

11:47.870 --> 11:48.980
Hold on, let me get ready.

11:51.150 --> 11:51.700
Come on.

11:52.670 --> 11:53.490
I'm ready.

11:53.510 --> 11:54.180
Here.

11:54.670 --> 11:55.530
Three, two...

12:03.150 --> 12:03.650
Well?

12:03.670 --> 12:04.700
I accepted my loss.

12:04.840 --> 12:05.700
Would you?

12:09.360 --> 12:11.580
Uncle, you leave nothing to chance.

12:12.600 --> 12:15.610
No wonder you're the Warden.

12:17.670 --> 12:18.610
I shall take my leave.

12:19.870 --> 12:21.530
Do come again next time!

12:21.870 --> 12:23.010
I refuse to believe

12:23.080 --> 12:24.460
I can't beat you just once.

12:25.670 --> 12:26.460
Sure.

12:26.480 --> 12:27.420
Goodbye.

12:30.120 --> 12:31.250
This game...

12:33.900 --> 12:35.580
[Steady, Certain Victory]

12:35.600 --> 12:36.340
Senior,

12:36.360 --> 12:37.370
with one glance,

12:37.390 --> 12:38.890
you'd know
where the Skyscraping Vine is?

12:39.000 --> 12:40.060
Of course not.

12:40.270 --> 12:41.220
But, you see,

12:41.440 --> 12:42.340
I have this.

12:43.000 --> 12:44.370
It's called the Soul-Capturing Pearl.

12:44.390 --> 12:46.370
It has a powerful function.

12:46.390 --> 12:47.850
It records everything the wearer

12:47.870 --> 12:49.850
sees before their eyes.

12:50.840 --> 12:51.850
I'm ready.

12:52.080 --> 12:54.340
This is called image recording.

12:55.000 --> 12:55.820
Watch closely.

12:59.240 --> 13:00.820
It is truly miraculous!

13:00.870 --> 13:01.980
That is nothing yet.

13:02.000 --> 13:03.340
There's something even more amazing.

13:06.600 --> 13:08.700
It can even pause at will.

13:08.840 --> 13:10.730
Could this be the Image Recording Art?

13:10.750 --> 13:12.580
It's beyond the Image Recording Art.

13:12.600 --> 13:14.530
It is called the Montage Art.

13:16.080 --> 13:18.580
What an astonishing art!

13:18.600 --> 13:19.730
Let us search

13:19.750 --> 13:21.650
for the precious Skyscraping Vine.

13:28.200 --> 13:29.730
[Mass Grave, Cattle Land]
Miasma Grove.

13:30.600 --> 13:32.010
Kuru Land.

13:35.700 --> 13:38.380
[Skyscraping Vine]

13:38.510 --> 13:39.300
Here it is.

13:40.790 --> 13:41.850
Mission accomplished!

13:45.790 --> 13:47.130
Copy the Scripture
of Steadiness 300 times.

13:48.000 --> 13:48.770
Uncle Jiu Wu must've seen

13:48.790 --> 13:50.460
you move that weiqi piece.

13:50.480 --> 13:51.770
He just didn't expose it.

13:51.790 --> 13:53.820
You broke Article 16, Rule 6

13:53.840 --> 13:55.530
of the Humanity Oath.

13:55.600 --> 13:56.370
No.

13:56.390 --> 13:58.420
That only calls for 250 copies.

13:58.600 --> 13:59.530
Then what about the extra 50?

13:59.550 --> 14:00.130
What are those for?

14:01.150 --> 14:02.340
We agreed beforehand:

14:02.360 --> 14:03.250
I cause the trouble;

14:03.270 --> 14:04.530
you take the blame.

14:07.720 --> 14:08.490
Fine.

14:08.960 --> 14:09.940
I will copy it.

14:13.270 --> 14:14.100
But Senior,

14:14.270 --> 14:16.220
why do you need the Skyscraping Vine?

14:20.120 --> 14:22.940
Find the realm ruling all living beings.

14:23.150 --> 14:24.420
The Celestial Court.

14:24.440 --> 14:25.890
Li Changshou,

14:26.550 --> 14:27.730
do you like

14:28.270 --> 14:29.420
the Great Tribulation?

14:34.510 --> 14:35.770
Senior, say something.

14:36.200 --> 14:38.340
Can you guarantee you get assigned
to Miasma Grove?

14:41.200 --> 14:42.220
I am not telling you.

14:52.940 --> 14:57.060
[Ascendance Sect, spirit testing
for the Trial Assembly]

15:05.260 --> 15:11.780
[Ascension Stage, Refining Stage,
Reversion Stage, Reunion Stage]

15:12.200 --> 15:13.370
These three:

15:13.390 --> 15:16.980
Refining Stage VII, Ascension Stage III,
and Reversion Stage II.

15:17.480 --> 15:19.010
We request the Elders' judgment.

15:19.010 --> 15:20.140
[Trial Grouping]

15:28.750 --> 15:30.010
[Kuru Land, Miasma Grove]
The destinations have been decided

15:30.270 --> 15:32.130
[Jambu Land, Jingwei Island]
according to your cultivation.

15:32.150 --> 15:33.220
[Cattle Land, Mass Grave]
They are

15:34.960 --> 15:36.530
Mass Grave, Western Land,

15:37.030 --> 15:38.490
Firecloud Grotto, North Land,

15:38.870 --> 15:40.850
and Jingwei Island, South Land.

15:42.600 --> 15:43.890
Excellent.

15:44.000 --> 15:45.850
Such progress since last time.

15:45.870 --> 15:48.770
I'm so proud of you.

15:48.790 --> 15:50.420
Come, let us drink to it!

15:57.550 --> 15:58.250
Next one, come up.

16:00.000 --> 16:00.610
Come.

16:01.000 --> 16:02.180
Zhang Henan, Mistveil Division.

16:02.600 --> 16:03.940
Chen Ziting, Spiritkin Division.

16:03.960 --> 16:05.770
Why isn't Senior here yet?

16:09.860 --> 16:14.860
[Griefbane Division,
Elder Evaluation Site]

16:14.870 --> 16:16.340
This move is a bit off.

16:16.340 --> 16:17.900
[Jiang Jingshan, Sect Elder,
Lord of Skyrend Division]

16:19.480 --> 16:22.010
Everyone is acting like fools.

16:22.360 --> 16:23.340
In this freezing cold,

16:23.360 --> 16:24.730
why climb so high?

16:38.720 --> 16:39.580
Senior Qi.

16:42.960 --> 16:43.700
Old friend.

16:44.360 --> 16:45.420
Long time no see.

16:45.550 --> 16:47.100
Still as mischievous as ever.

16:48.120 --> 16:49.820
You're old, indeed,

16:50.200 --> 16:51.890
but no longer my friend.

16:54.360 --> 16:55.980
I heard of your two disciples:

16:56.000 --> 16:57.580
one eloquent and persuasive,

16:57.600 --> 16:59.180
the other improving by leaps.

16:59.200 --> 17:00.580
You are truly blessed.

17:02.750 --> 17:03.530
Kuai Si.

17:04.720 --> 17:05.620
Let me tell you.

17:06.310 --> 17:08.330
Ling'e joining my division

17:08.350 --> 17:10.220
follows the sect's rules.

17:10.790 --> 17:12.090
You can't go back on your word.

17:13.640 --> 17:15.140
What are you saying?

17:15.350 --> 17:18.010
I'm happy for you.

17:19.160 --> 17:20.290
For this trial,

17:20.440 --> 17:22.220
you must pick good places

17:22.400 --> 17:25.140
for your two dear disciples.

17:27.510 --> 17:28.330
What do you mean?

17:33.110 --> 17:34.980
Did I say you could leave?

17:35.960 --> 17:36.730
What?

17:36.750 --> 17:38.420
Lan Ling'e, Jade Division:

17:38.550 --> 17:39.900
Reversion Stage I.

17:40.750 --> 17:42.620
Ling'e's improved remarkably.

17:43.030 --> 17:45.620
Jingwei Island seems fitting.

17:45.830 --> 17:47.730
What do you all think?

17:48.160 --> 17:49.090
No objections.

17:49.350 --> 17:51.010
Neither do I.

17:51.720 --> 17:55.250
Senior Qi, you have no objections?

18:04.830 --> 18:06.180
Ling'e, good for you.

18:06.200 --> 18:07.180
You've grown a lot.

18:07.200 --> 18:09.140
The elders assigned you
to Jingwei Island.

18:09.830 --> 18:10.860
Though it is dangerous,

18:10.880 --> 18:12.090
[Jambu Land, Jingwei Island]
I believe you can handle it.

18:12.110 --> 18:12.810
You'll be fine.

18:14.000 --> 18:15.180
Thank you, Aunt.

18:15.240 --> 18:15.980
Go now.

18:23.750 --> 18:25.330
Senior, you're finally here.

18:25.350 --> 18:26.010
How did it go?

18:27.350 --> 18:28.140
Not so great.

18:29.240 --> 18:30.730
Jingwei Island is great.

18:30.750 --> 18:31.490
Why say not so great?

18:31.510 --> 18:32.460
But I didn't get

18:32.480 --> 18:33.900
the Miasma Grove you wanted.

18:34.640 --> 18:35.660
Miasma Grove is dangerous.

18:35.680 --> 18:36.940
You can't go with me.

18:38.000 --> 18:38.770
But, Senior,

18:38.790 --> 18:40.860
the Innate Treasure tests cultivation;

18:40.880 --> 18:42.770
then the elders assign by results.

18:42.830 --> 18:43.700
How can you be sure

18:43.720 --> 18:45.250
you'll end up in Kuru Land?

18:46.160 --> 18:46.980
Well, about that,

18:47.750 --> 18:49.490
I have a plan.

18:52.030 --> 18:52.420
Who is this?

18:53.830 --> 18:54.770
Which division is she from?

18:54.790 --> 18:55.330
I have never seen her before.

18:55.350 --> 18:56.330
Who is she?

19:17.750 --> 19:18.250
Hey, Pretty.

19:18.350 --> 19:18.980
No, no.

19:20.550 --> 19:21.330
Junior.

19:22.070 --> 19:23.660
Are you a new disciple?

19:25.960 --> 19:28.900
You're not joining Aunt Jiang Jingshan,
are you?

19:29.640 --> 19:31.050
She's the Lord of Skyrend Division,

19:31.070 --> 19:32.220
Warden of the Discipline Hall.

19:32.240 --> 19:35.460
She's rumored to be hot-tempered
and scornful.

19:36.440 --> 19:38.900
Her disciple, Youqin Xuanya,

19:39.200 --> 19:41.090
is known as our top immortal candidate.

19:42.240 --> 19:43.810
Though I haven't seen her,

19:43.960 --> 19:45.700
she probably takes after her mentor.

19:45.880 --> 19:47.940
She must be fierce-looking too.

19:49.440 --> 19:52.250
How knowledgeable of you, Senior.

19:55.000 --> 19:57.090
Calling me Senior feels so distant.

19:58.240 --> 20:01.250
[Wang Qi, Spiritkin Division]
I'm Wang Qi of Spiritkin Division.

20:04.920 --> 20:06.380
May I ask your name?

20:06.640 --> 20:07.620
[Youqin Xuanya]
I'm Youqin Xuanya

20:07.620 --> 20:09.210
[Skyrend Division]
of Skyrend Division.

20:09.450 --> 20:10.730
[Sixth Princess of the Donglin Kingdom]
Nice to meet you.

20:12.440 --> 20:13.290
Xuanya.

20:16.880 --> 20:17.700
Xuanya.

20:19.590 --> 20:21.700
Senior Yuan Qing, long time no see.

20:23.720 --> 20:24.730
Long time no see.

20:25.350 --> 20:26.900
Skyrend, Youqin Xuanya.

20:27.070 --> 20:28.290
Mistveil, Yuan Qing.

20:28.640 --> 20:29.140
Come up.

20:35.790 --> 20:37.570
Senior, you're putting on an act.

20:37.590 --> 20:39.180
A beauty like a flower.

20:39.350 --> 20:40.460
You don't even...

20:40.830 --> 20:42.770
Others see only her appearance.

20:42.790 --> 20:45.250
But what I see

20:45.350 --> 20:47.330
is karma.

20:48.790 --> 20:50.140
Here comes Xuanya.

20:51.110 --> 20:55.330
That's Yuan Qing
of Mistveil Division, right?

20:56.400 --> 20:57.570
Both so young,

20:57.920 --> 21:00.620
already at Reversion Stage V!

21:00.680 --> 21:01.940
Impressive!

21:03.000 --> 21:04.730
Senior Jiang, Junior Kuai,

21:04.750 --> 21:06.730
what are your plans?

21:07.070 --> 21:08.460
Xuanya mentioned

21:08.750 --> 21:11.220
she wants to gather herbs
in Miasma Grove.

21:11.750 --> 21:13.490
Though it's no safe place,

21:13.590 --> 21:15.140
it's good training for her.

21:16.720 --> 21:18.730
They're childhood sweethearts.

21:19.160 --> 21:22.530
Naturally, Yuan Qing
wants to go with her.

21:23.640 --> 21:24.330
Understood.

21:24.350 --> 21:25.700
But these two

21:26.240 --> 21:28.290
are this generation's best,

21:28.350 --> 21:29.810
plus Liu Yan'er of Gravecap

21:29.830 --> 21:31.180
and Wang Qi of Spiritkin.

21:31.310 --> 21:32.940
If all these talents

21:32.960 --> 21:34.770
are going to Miasma Grove,

21:35.160 --> 21:36.660
that seems a bit wasteful.

21:37.110 --> 21:38.050
Why not

21:38.960 --> 21:39.980
split them up a bit?

21:40.200 --> 21:41.770
No need to split them up.

21:42.030 --> 21:44.460
Yuan Qing goes to Kuru Land.

21:44.920 --> 21:45.770
Kuai Si,

21:46.350 --> 21:47.770
what an arrogant

21:47.790 --> 21:49.250
and autocratic manner.

21:50.440 --> 21:53.530
Warden Jiang is quite blunt.

21:53.550 --> 21:56.330
I'll send my disciple with yours.

21:56.750 --> 21:59.620
Why not accept this goodwill?

22:01.750 --> 22:03.140
I watched Yuan Qing

22:03.160 --> 22:04.730
and Xuanya grow up.

22:04.750 --> 22:07.290
As for young people's hearts,

22:07.550 --> 22:08.380
no need to guess.

22:08.480 --> 22:09.330
No need to guess.

22:09.790 --> 22:10.250
I understand.

22:10.960 --> 22:11.700
Very well.

22:12.030 --> 22:12.900
Let Yuan Qing

22:12.920 --> 22:14.250
have his wish.

22:14.270 --> 22:15.810
If it leads to a match,

22:15.830 --> 22:17.250
that would be a fine thing.

22:18.110 --> 22:18.900
However,

22:19.270 --> 22:20.530
in that case,

22:20.550 --> 22:23.420
this team's strength

22:23.720 --> 22:24.700
would be much better.

22:25.200 --> 22:26.660
We should add

22:27.440 --> 22:29.420
a slightly weaker disciple.

22:31.110 --> 22:33.010
Weaker?

22:36.270 --> 22:37.330
Xuanya, Yuan Qing,

22:37.960 --> 22:40.140
look after each other in Kuru Land.

22:46.720 --> 22:47.730
You rascal.

22:47.750 --> 22:48.940
Satisfied now?

22:50.580 --> 22:51.860
[Kuru Land, Miasma Grove]

22:55.680 --> 22:56.940
Thank you, Aunt.

22:57.510 --> 22:58.090
Thank you, Aunt.

22:58.110 --> 22:58.980
Go, go, go.

22:59.350 --> 23:00.380
Let's go, Xuanya.

23:02.590 --> 23:04.660
Jade Division, Li Changshou.

23:05.350 --> 23:06.140
Your turn, Senior.

23:08.400 --> 23:08.860
Coming.

23:23.310 --> 23:24.330
Everyone,

23:24.640 --> 23:26.940
what cultivation level

23:26.960 --> 23:28.620
would suit this disciple?

23:29.000 --> 23:29.980
Ascension Stage IX?

23:30.350 --> 23:32.540
♪I dare to live my own way♪

23:32.540 --> 23:34.340
♪In the Primordial World♪

23:34.340 --> 23:35.100
[Reversion Stage]

23:35.100 --> 23:35.940
[Reunion Stage]

23:35.940 --> 23:36.620
[Ascension Stage]

23:36.970 --> 23:38.700
♪The stars smile at fireflies♪

23:38.700 --> 23:40.820
[Stage VIII]

23:40.820 --> 23:42.380
[Stage IX]

23:43.350 --> 23:44.810
Not bad, Changshou.

23:44.960 --> 23:46.570
Since when are you so capable?

23:50.200 --> 23:51.530
If Changshou goes to Miasma Grove,

23:51.550 --> 23:52.900
he won't know what hit him.

23:53.400 --> 23:54.090
Well.

23:54.240 --> 23:55.730
Isn't that a bit wasteful?

23:58.550 --> 23:59.330
Then,

23:59.590 --> 24:01.140
Refining Stage IX?

24:01.860 --> 24:03.780
[Ascension Stage]

24:03.780 --> 24:04.660
[Refining Stage]

24:04.680 --> 24:05.940
How'd you regress?

24:06.240 --> 24:07.140
That's also wasteful.

24:08.830 --> 24:10.810
Changshou's trying to kill me!

24:11.930 --> 24:14.020
♪Let the thoughts weigh♪

24:14.020 --> 24:16.260
[Stage VIII, Stage IX]

24:16.710 --> 24:17.410
♪Unruly♪

24:17.410 --> 24:20.440
♪A carefree smile♪

24:20.440 --> 24:21.090
Forget it.

24:21.350 --> 24:22.620
Why not Refining Stage IV?

24:22.750 --> 24:23.530
Refining Stage IV?

24:23.550 --> 24:24.980
That's Miasma Grove!

24:25.000 --> 24:26.530
He'll be too weak.

24:26.960 --> 24:27.730
It's fine.

24:27.750 --> 24:28.940
Yuan Qing's there.

24:28.960 --> 24:30.730
He'll protect him.

24:31.920 --> 24:33.530
You're just worried
that if the others are too strong,

24:33.550 --> 24:35.220
they'll steal your disciple's treasures.

24:36.270 --> 24:37.380
Let's keep looking.

24:38.480 --> 24:40.290
Ascension Stage fits better.

24:40.920 --> 24:41.530
Then,

24:41.720 --> 24:43.090
Ascension Stage I?

24:45.660 --> 24:46.340
[Refining Stage]

24:46.340 --> 24:47.140
[Ascension Stage]

24:48.830 --> 24:49.620
No, no.

24:49.720 --> 24:50.250
I think

24:50.510 --> 24:52.090
Refining Stage is better.

24:52.750 --> 24:53.980
But then the gap isn't wide enough.

24:54.480 --> 24:55.420
Ascension Stage III?

24:55.720 --> 24:56.770
Refining Stage is better.

24:56.830 --> 24:57.730
Refining Stage.

24:57.830 --> 25:00.140
Stop arguing. Refining Stage II it is.

25:00.920 --> 25:02.530
Safety first for this trial.

25:03.030 --> 25:04.180
Refining Stage III is better.

25:04.550 --> 25:05.770
Ascension Stage IV.

25:06.550 --> 25:07.570
Ascension Stage III.

25:08.060 --> 25:08.960
[Refining Stage, Ascension Stage,
Reversion Stage]

25:08.960 --> 25:10.700
[Stage IX, Stage VIII, Stage I]
No, Ascension Stage II.

25:10.960 --> 25:12.250
What's going on?

25:12.510 --> 25:13.730
Release all your Qi, quickly.

25:13.750 --> 25:14.700
Stop dawdling!

25:14.720 --> 25:15.380
Yes.

25:17.110 --> 25:17.980
It's settled, then.

25:18.720 --> 25:22.330
Pick a disciple at Ascension Stage II.

25:25.940 --> 25:27.860
[Ascension Stage]

25:27.860 --> 25:29.580
[Stage II]

25:31.270 --> 25:32.220
You rascal.

25:32.240 --> 25:34.250
You really haven't improved.

25:35.510 --> 25:36.700
Just playing it steady.

25:37.070 --> 25:38.180
And you're proud of it?

25:39.200 --> 25:40.700
Li Changshou, Jade Division.

25:40.750 --> 25:42.010
Ascension Stage II.

25:47.790 --> 25:50.490
He walks right into it.

25:51.200 --> 25:53.490
It seems heaven wills it.

25:54.550 --> 25:57.050
Let Li Changshou, Jade Division,

25:57.070 --> 25:59.490
join the Miasma Grove team.

26:01.200 --> 26:03.810
Senior, rest assured.

26:04.160 --> 26:05.770
He's Yuan Qing's peer.

26:05.790 --> 26:08.220
I'll ask Yuan Qing

26:08.750 --> 26:10.290
to look after him closely.

26:13.220 --> 26:14.340
[Kuru Land, Miasma Grove]

26:14.510 --> 26:15.290
Aunt,

26:16.110 --> 26:18.140
do I really have to go

26:18.550 --> 26:19.660
to Miasma Grove?

26:20.720 --> 26:21.620
Stop shaking first.

26:21.640 --> 26:23.010
I'll put in a good word.

26:23.030 --> 26:23.770
Don't be scared.

26:23.960 --> 26:24.290
All right.

26:24.310 --> 26:24.700
Don't be afraid.

26:24.720 --> 26:26.810
Since the result is decided,

26:26.830 --> 26:28.620
changing it arbitrarily

26:28.960 --> 26:31.330
would be unfair to others.

26:32.030 --> 26:32.980
What do you mean?

26:33.830 --> 26:35.050
Heaven's will cannot be defied.

26:35.960 --> 26:36.730
I'll go

26:37.480 --> 26:39.770
to Miasma Grove.

26:42.440 --> 26:43.010
Changshou...

26:45.510 --> 26:46.770
Changshou...

27:00.790 --> 27:02.530
I'm leading this trial.

27:02.550 --> 27:04.380
Destination: Miasma Grove.

27:04.750 --> 27:06.090
Five members per team.

27:06.480 --> 27:08.180
We have: First in the last trial,

27:08.200 --> 27:09.620
[Liu Yan'er, Gravecap Division]
Youqin Xuanya, Skyrend.

27:09.640 --> 27:11.140
Second, Yuan Qing, Mistveil.

27:11.160 --> 27:12.900
17th, Wang Qi, Spiritkin.

27:12.920 --> 27:14.860
44th, Liu Yan'er, Gravecap.

27:14.880 --> 27:15.460
And finally,

27:16.160 --> 27:17.620
Li Changshou, Jade.

27:18.000 --> 27:20.530
The 2,222nd.

27:21.270 --> 27:22.730
You really are something.

27:22.790 --> 27:23.490
If it weren't for you,

27:23.510 --> 27:24.140
Junior.

27:24.160 --> 27:26.140
- Here, sorry.
- You ranked last in the trial.

27:26.440 --> 27:27.140
Stop that.

27:27.920 --> 27:29.050
I can't enter the exam hall.

27:29.070 --> 27:30.140
I can't keep you safe.

27:30.480 --> 27:32.250
This isn't some market.

27:32.550 --> 27:33.730
Even your mentor

27:33.750 --> 27:35.220
didn't come out unscathed.

27:35.240 --> 27:36.980
My mentor went there too?

27:37.160 --> 27:39.010
Ask him if you want to know.

27:39.030 --> 27:41.380
Anyway, good luck to you all.

27:46.920 --> 27:47.660
Junior Changshou.

27:48.830 --> 27:49.290
This...

27:49.960 --> 27:50.810
Your hair is so soft.

27:51.350 --> 27:51.810
Not bad.

27:52.270 --> 27:53.620
Rest easy, Junior Changshou.

27:54.110 --> 27:55.380
We're destined to be teammates.

27:55.510 --> 27:56.980
I'll keep you safe.

27:59.880 --> 28:01.730
Xuanya, don't you worry.

28:01.880 --> 28:02.980
No matter the dangers,

28:03.000 --> 28:05.420
I'll find
the Fire-Repelling Herb for you.

28:06.640 --> 28:08.220
This is my own cultivation.

28:08.550 --> 28:10.330
Senior Yuan Qing, don't worry.

28:10.400 --> 28:11.220
Exactly.

28:11.240 --> 28:13.420
Mind yourself, Yuan Qing.

28:14.830 --> 28:16.180
Junior, don't be afraid.

28:16.440 --> 28:18.460
My mentor mentioned Miasma Grove.

28:18.480 --> 28:19.420
Though it is perilous,

28:19.440 --> 28:21.860
it's not as scary as Aunt Jiu says.

28:22.750 --> 28:23.570
In comparison,

28:23.590 --> 28:25.380
if you meet the Dragon Clan
in the East Sea,

28:25.400 --> 28:26.860
that would be truly dangerous.

28:27.750 --> 28:28.250
Dragon?

28:29.960 --> 28:30.980
Let me tell you,

28:31.000 --> 28:32.250
the Dragon Clan in East Sea

28:32.270 --> 28:34.180
relies on their former sea dominance

28:34.200 --> 28:35.700
and stirs up trouble,

28:35.720 --> 28:36.810
bringing calamity to all.

28:36.830 --> 28:39.290
With our Ascendance Sect around,

28:39.310 --> 28:40.620
they wouldn't dare act out.

28:40.640 --> 28:42.940
But if they ever get a pretext,

28:43.480 --> 28:46.490
humans and dragons
will inevitably clash.

28:49.440 --> 28:50.900
The Dragon Clan in East Sea.

28:50.920 --> 28:52.420
What are you muttering about?

28:52.440 --> 28:53.460
Listen to me carefully.

28:54.000 --> 28:55.420
If you face a foe you can't beat,

28:55.480 --> 28:56.420
just run.

28:56.680 --> 28:57.810
You must survive at all costs.

28:57.830 --> 28:59.380
Survival comes first.

29:00.160 --> 29:01.700
Especially you, Changshou.

29:03.110 --> 29:05.010
What's wrong with your cultivation?

29:05.310 --> 29:06.490
Your talent is clearly decent.

29:06.510 --> 29:07.420
This shouldn't be.

29:07.440 --> 29:08.660
Just steady.

29:10.440 --> 29:11.220
Aunt,

29:11.400 --> 29:13.700
our division's secret art

29:13.720 --> 29:15.330
is best at reading Qi refiners' states.

29:15.400 --> 29:17.330
More precise than a Spirit Diagram.

29:17.350 --> 29:17.980
Test him with it, quickly.

29:18.000 --> 29:18.770
Hurry, hurry!

29:19.790 --> 29:20.570
No, no, no.

29:20.750 --> 29:21.380
No, no.

29:21.680 --> 29:22.380
Why are you shouting?

29:22.400 --> 29:23.620
- Quick!
- No, Aunt.

29:24.030 --> 29:24.900
I'll come clean.

29:25.160 --> 29:28.140
The reason
my cultivation stayed the same

29:28.160 --> 29:28.770
is that I

29:30.110 --> 29:32.140
was too impatient.

29:32.160 --> 29:33.330
I wanted a shortcut.

29:33.830 --> 29:34.620
So,

29:34.880 --> 29:35.940
I tried all kinds of pills.

29:36.350 --> 29:37.490
Not only did it not improve,

29:37.510 --> 29:38.140
but also...

29:38.750 --> 29:40.140
It also...

29:41.750 --> 29:43.140
I contracted a condition:

29:43.310 --> 29:45.730
Touching a woman makes me convulse.

29:50.720 --> 29:51.730
You just said

29:51.880 --> 29:54.010
you convulse when you touch a woman?

29:58.510 --> 29:59.730
I've never heard of that.

30:00.000 --> 30:00.810
Is that a real condition?

30:00.830 --> 30:02.090
Yes, yes, there is.

30:02.200 --> 30:02.660
There really is.

30:03.030 --> 30:03.730
Aunt,

30:04.310 --> 30:06.420
since Changshou can't touch women,

30:06.680 --> 30:07.620
I'll do it, then.

30:07.640 --> 30:08.320
- Quick.
- Senior.

30:08.680 --> 30:09.860
Senior Yuan Qing, you doubt me?

30:09.910 --> 30:10.290
I...

30:10.310 --> 30:11.350
Why won't you believe me?

30:11.410 --> 30:11.810
Fine, I...

30:11.830 --> 30:12.940
I'll prove it to you.

30:12.960 --> 30:13.660
You forced my hand.

30:16.030 --> 30:16.700
Changshou,

30:17.510 --> 30:18.900
he never said he didn't believe you.

30:18.920 --> 30:19.460
Is it true or not?

30:19.480 --> 30:20.980
- Not on me!
- Girls, don't touch Changshou.

30:21.000 --> 30:21.330
Are you all right?

30:21.350 --> 30:22.730
That boy, keep Changshou safe.

30:22.750 --> 30:24.250
Let's find a place to stay first.

30:24.680 --> 30:26.730
Changshou!

30:26.730 --> 30:28.780
[Anshui Tavern, Donglin Kingdom]

30:28.790 --> 30:30.250
Senior, careful! Careful!

30:31.590 --> 30:33.010
Rest a moment, Senior.

30:35.960 --> 30:36.860
Today, I lost composure

30:36.880 --> 30:38.900
before Aunt and fellow disciples

30:39.270 --> 30:40.620
and delayed our journey.

30:40.750 --> 30:42.660
I'm utterly ashamed.

30:43.310 --> 30:44.220
I had intended

30:44.960 --> 30:47.660
to take this secret to my grave.

30:49.480 --> 30:50.700
Forget it, stay away from him.

30:50.720 --> 30:51.380
Stay away, don't touch him.

30:51.400 --> 30:52.010
Don't touch him.

30:52.400 --> 30:52.940
It's all my fault.

30:52.960 --> 30:53.900
It's all my fault.

30:53.920 --> 30:55.140
I'll drink three cups
as self-punishment.

31:03.160 --> 31:05.530
Senior, I prepared some Miasma Talismans

31:06.000 --> 31:07.420
and Detoxification Pills for you.

31:07.440 --> 31:10.140
I hope they can help.

31:10.240 --> 31:11.290
If you don't accept them,

31:11.590 --> 31:12.420
I cannot be at ease.

31:13.200 --> 31:13.810
No need.

31:14.110 --> 31:15.420
I appreciate the thought.

31:16.270 --> 31:18.220
This perilous cultivation

31:18.400 --> 31:19.900
is to temper body and mind.

31:20.240 --> 31:21.770
If I rely on external aids,

31:21.830 --> 31:23.900
it would put the cart before the horse.

31:25.750 --> 31:26.900
Thanks for your guidance.

31:27.240 --> 31:28.010
Senior,

31:28.640 --> 31:31.730
though your cultivation is lower,

31:32.030 --> 31:33.660
your will is strong and resilient.

31:33.680 --> 31:34.900
You will surely achieve greatness.

31:35.720 --> 31:36.730
The path ahead is long.

31:36.750 --> 31:37.810
Do not lose heart.

31:37.830 --> 31:38.860
Let us encourage each other.

31:41.400 --> 31:42.180
Sure.

32:02.260 --> 32:06.020
[Yuwen Ling, General of Donglin Kingdom]

32:14.880 --> 32:15.700
Yuan Qing.

32:16.590 --> 32:17.330
Come here quickly.

32:20.830 --> 32:21.730
I'm Yuwen Ling.

32:22.000 --> 32:23.090
Greetings, Young Master Yuan Qing.

32:23.640 --> 32:24.490
Greetings, Your Highness.

32:27.830 --> 32:28.570
Rise.

32:34.510 --> 32:36.330
Anshui City is part of Donglin Kingdom.

32:36.510 --> 32:38.090
And Xuanya's mortal identity

32:38.110 --> 32:40.660
is the Sixth Princess
of Donglin Kingdom.

32:41.030 --> 32:42.660
How do you know so clearly?

32:42.680 --> 32:45.290
I'm the fourth son
of the Senior Grandee.

32:45.350 --> 32:47.010
I've known her since childhood.

32:47.510 --> 32:50.090
No wonder you're always after her.

32:50.270 --> 32:51.900
So, you're childhood sweethearts.

32:52.110 --> 32:53.090
I have affection,

32:53.750 --> 32:55.140
but she has none.

32:58.510 --> 32:59.530
I didn't call them here.

33:00.070 --> 33:01.490
We're seeking immortality.

33:01.640 --> 33:03.250
You idlers shouldn't meddle.

33:03.270 --> 33:04.460
Even if Her Highness forbids it,

33:05.270 --> 33:06.940
I won't stand idly by.

33:08.070 --> 33:09.490
These ten are our elite.

33:09.510 --> 33:10.860
Each is a match for ten thousand.

33:16.110 --> 33:16.900
What did you just say?

33:17.110 --> 33:17.860
I didn't catch that.

33:34.350 --> 33:35.220
Truly impressive.

33:38.030 --> 33:40.490
I alone match ten thousand.

33:40.960 --> 33:41.810
You can't beat me.

33:42.550 --> 33:43.530
Look at me.

33:43.550 --> 33:47.180
I alone match ten thousand.

33:47.750 --> 33:48.660
Alright, alright.

33:49.960 --> 33:50.620
Go put on clothes.

33:51.790 --> 33:52.460
Truly impressive.

33:55.240 --> 33:56.180
Bring the clothes.

33:56.880 --> 33:57.460
Aunt,

33:57.640 --> 33:58.570
he cultivates too.

33:58.720 --> 33:59.730
And he's very strong.

34:00.550 --> 34:01.570
Stronger than all of you.

34:02.960 --> 34:04.810
With a mortal post,

34:04.830 --> 34:06.940
he's even a Primordial Immortal.

34:07.880 --> 34:08.860
Interesting.

34:09.920 --> 34:10.820
If you can keep up,

34:11.400 --> 34:12.170
then follow us.

34:23.180 --> 34:27.580
[Miasma Grove]

34:28.070 --> 34:30.690
Miasma fills the grove;
beasts lurk around.

34:30.960 --> 34:32.530
No sword flight allowed here.

34:32.960 --> 34:34.860
The miasma will suppress your powers.

34:35.360 --> 34:37.010
This trial lasts seven days.

34:37.440 --> 34:38.860
No early departure.

34:38.880 --> 34:40.490
Give it your all.

34:40.510 --> 34:42.940
I'll patrol the perimeter.

34:43.840 --> 34:46.490
If you face insurmountable danger,

34:46.760 --> 34:48.050
crush the Message Jade.

34:48.230 --> 34:49.690
I'll descend from the sky

34:49.710 --> 34:50.900
to rescue you.

34:52.110 --> 34:55.610
As for this brave warrior...

34:58.840 --> 34:59.530
Me?

34:59.550 --> 35:00.260
Who else?

35:00.280 --> 35:01.050
Understood.

35:02.400 --> 35:03.650
I will stand guard here.

35:03.670 --> 35:04.860
Awaiting your triumph, Your Highness.

35:05.190 --> 35:05.860
Alright.

35:05.880 --> 35:07.420
I won't have to tie you up.

35:07.440 --> 35:08.530
You'd have to be able to tie me up.

35:08.840 --> 35:10.050
General Yuwen, rest assured.

35:10.070 --> 35:11.570
I'll risk my life

35:12.150 --> 35:14.010
to keep Xuanya safe.

35:16.000 --> 35:17.530
You must be careful.

35:17.840 --> 35:19.690
Miasma Grove is full
of demons and beasts.

35:19.710 --> 35:20.690
It's extremely dangerous.

35:21.360 --> 35:22.530
You must be cautious.

35:42.320 --> 35:43.940
No, no, no. Don't be afraid.

35:44.630 --> 35:45.420
It's all right.

35:49.280 --> 35:51.010
Ahead lies the Grove's depths.

35:51.480 --> 35:52.740
Everyone, be extremely careful.

35:53.440 --> 35:54.980
Get your magic instruments ready.

35:57.510 --> 35:58.130
Be careful.

35:58.550 --> 35:58.940
Let's go.

35:58.960 --> 35:59.460
Careful.

36:15.880 --> 36:18.570
Isn't Miasma Grove
supposed to be dangerous?

36:19.150 --> 36:20.170
Along the way,

36:20.670 --> 36:21.820
let alone demons,

36:22.280 --> 36:24.090
we haven't even seen a mosquito.

36:25.360 --> 36:27.780
Aside from the oppressive foul aura,

36:28.150 --> 36:30.460
it's not as perilous as Aunt said.

36:33.230 --> 36:34.010
Everyone,

36:34.710 --> 36:36.170
this place is safe for now.

36:36.320 --> 36:37.650
Let's part ways for now.

36:38.070 --> 36:38.980
Let's each seek secret treasures.

36:39.280 --> 36:39.780
Alright.

36:41.760 --> 36:42.610
Xuanya, be careful.

36:56.000 --> 36:56.940
Senior, are you alright?

36:58.110 --> 36:58.940
Are you alright?

37:01.510 --> 37:02.780
Though no demons or beasts are here,

37:03.590 --> 37:05.130
there's still miasma poison.

37:05.320 --> 37:06.570
We must not let our guard down.

37:07.320 --> 37:08.090
Xuanya,

37:08.920 --> 37:10.210
we should go together.

37:10.320 --> 37:11.690
That way, we can look out
for each other.

37:17.960 --> 37:19.130
Wang Qi and I

37:19.150 --> 37:20.740
will head north for plants.

37:20.920 --> 37:22.050
We won't disturb you then.

37:22.630 --> 37:23.610
Senior Changshou?

37:25.440 --> 37:27.460
This path is far too dangerous.

37:27.480 --> 37:28.900
It's beyond my level.

37:28.920 --> 37:31.050
I'll take this path.

37:32.070 --> 37:32.780
- Farewell.
- Senior.

37:36.440 --> 37:37.420
See you outside.

37:38.440 --> 37:39.860
In such a perilous place,

37:40.110 --> 37:41.690
Senior Changshou goes alone,

37:41.710 --> 37:42.860
unwilling to burden others.

37:43.230 --> 37:45.570
His courage is truly rare.

37:50.800 --> 37:52.010
This trial will last seven days.

37:52.030 --> 37:53.570
No one may leave early.

37:53.670 --> 37:54.300
When they run

37:54.320 --> 37:55.460
into trouble they cannot handle,

37:55.480 --> 37:57.300
they will crush the Message Jade.

37:57.320 --> 37:58.900
Then, Jiu Jiu will descend

37:58.920 --> 38:00.050
to rescue them.

38:01.800 --> 38:03.740
Is that clear to all of you?

38:05.150 --> 38:05.940
Remember.

38:06.150 --> 38:08.420
This time, your targets are

38:09.630 --> 38:11.300
everyone here for the trial.

38:44.020 --> 38:49.800
♪See mortal joys and sorrows♪

38:50.470 --> 38:57.170
♪Reunions and partings, as fate unfolds♪

38:58.700 --> 39:04.750
♪Alas, love has many twists and turns♪

39:05.380 --> 39:11.830
♪Memories filled with sorrow♪

39:12.570 --> 39:19.690
♪Slowly, wishes turn to regret♪

39:20.070 --> 39:26.970
♪You've gone afar, like mist fading♪

39:27.350 --> 39:34.700
♪Tearfully,
this life's bond is not over♪

39:34.700 --> 39:41.870
♪Past fragments vanish into night♪

39:58.010 --> 40:03.180
♪Down a few more cups of wine♪

40:04.270 --> 40:11.290
♪Through land and sea,
I ask you to come♪

40:12.480 --> 40:18.420
♪For honor's sake, upright and grand♪

40:19.120 --> 40:26.200
♪Alas, our story is short♪

40:26.540 --> 40:33.650
♪Slowly, wishes turn to regret♪

40:33.970 --> 40:40.450
♪You've gone afar, like mist fading♪

40:41.230 --> 40:48.440
♪Tears fall, this fate's not done♪

40:48.830 --> 40:56.650
♪Past fragments vanish into night♪
